{"text": "From: Rhiannon Ashcombe <rhi@ashcombeceramics.example>\nTo: Dev Malhotra <dev.malhotra@fenwicklowther.example>\nCc: gethin.ashcombe@mailbox.example\nDate: Tue, 13 Jan 2026 21:47:05 +0000\nSubject: Starter details for Tolpuddle + stuff for my 2024/25 return\n\nHi Dev,\n\nSorry this is so late, I know the deadline is 31/01/2026. Everything you asked for is below, I think.\n\n1. New job\nI started at Tolpuddle Print Works Ltd on 5 January 2026 (three days a week). Their payroll lady Moira Tolhurst says she needs the starter checklist from you as you do their payroll?? Small world. Moira's number is 01632 960471.\n- NI number: QQ 41 87 23 C\n- DOB: 14th of March 1988\n- Their PAYE ref is 120/TP45873\n- Salary £18,720 a year pro rata, paid monthly, first pay 30.01.26\n- P45 from my old job shows tax code 1257L, pay to date £14,203.50, tax £1,112.20, leaving date 19/12/2025\n- Student loan: Plan 2, still about £21k left\n\n2. Self-employed (Ashcombe Ceramics)\n- UTR: 61884 20755\n- Turnover 6 April 2024 to 5 April 2025 was £23,418.76, expenses £9,870 (spreadsheet attached). About £4,100 of the sales came through Etsy and the rest from the stall at Gower Makers' Collective in Mumbles.\n- I paid £1,264.40 on account last July, reference 6188420755K.\n- Do I need to worry about VAT or Making Tax Digital yet?\n- Class 2 - I can't remember if I paid.\n\n3. Bank for the refund / wages\nSevernside Building Society, account name R E ASHCOMBE\nSort 57-87-59  Acct 72152880\nIBAN if you need it for anything: GB95 HBUK 5787 5972 1528 80\n(The joint one ending 4419 is for the mortgage, please don't use it.)\n\n4. Government Gateway\nUser ID 84 17 30 26 59 02, password is Kiln&Glaze!88 - I'll change it once you've pulled the SA302s for 2023/24 and 2024/25. The access code goes to my mobile 07700 900318.\n\n5. Other\n- Gethin wants to know if we should claim Marriage Allowance - he earned about £11,900 last year since he went part time after his back operation. His NI no. is QQ 60 22 91 A and he's copied in.\n- We moved on 1 Sept. New address: Flat 2, 17 Brynmill Terrace, Swansea SA2 0DP. Old one was 9 Heol Cennen, Llanelli, SA15 3QT - HMRC still writes to that.\n- Your invoice FL-10772 for £385.00 - paid today by bank transfer.\n\nThanks Dev. Ring me after 4 if anything's missing, landline (01632) 960 112.\n\nRhi\n\nPS Mr Malhotra is what Gethin Ashcombe insists on calling you, sorry in advance. He says Fenwick Lowther did his dad's probate.\n--\nRhiannon Ashcombe | Ashcombe Ceramics | www.ashcombeceramics.example | Fenwick Lowther Accountants Ltd client ref ASH0412", "kind": "Email", "detail": "446 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Rhiannon Ashcombe", "Dev Malhotra", "Gethin Ashcombe", "Moira Tolhurst", "R E ASHCOMBE", "Gethin", "Rhi", "Mr Malhotra", "Fenwick Lowther Accountants Ltd client ref ASH0412"], "companies": ["Ashcombe Ceramics", "Tolpuddle Print Works Ltd", "Fenwick Lowther", "Severnside Building Society", "Etsy", "Gower Makers' Collective", "mailbox", "ashcombeceramics.example", "fenwicklowther.example", "ashcombeceramics", "Fenwick Lowther Accountants Ltd"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.8999999985098839, "modelMs": 39293.699999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 23, "text": "Rhiannon Ashcombe", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Rhiannon Ashcombe"}, {"start": 25, "end": 53, "text": "rhi@ashcombeceramics.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "rhi@ashcombeceramics.example"}, {"start": 59, "end": 71, "text": "Dev Malhotra", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Dev Malhotra"}, {"start": 73, "end": 108, "text": "dev.malhotra@fenwicklowther.example", "kind": "email", "source":